"""
Hybrid Physics-ML Model for Permafrost Ground Temperature
==========================================================
TTOP (physics baseline) + ML Residual Learning

Workflow:
1. Calculate TTOP v1 for all samples (physics-based baseline)
2. Compute residuals: residual = MAGT_observed - TTOP
3. Train XGBoost/RF ensemble to predict residuals
4. Final prediction: MAGT_pred = TTOP + ML_residual

This lets ML focus on local corrections rather than
learning the full physics from scratch.
"""

